msgid "@RegisterForReflection"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `@RegisterForReflection` annotation instructs Quarkus to keep the class, "
"its fields, and methods when creating a native executable.\n"
"This is crucial when we later run our applications as native executables "
"within containers.\n"
"Without this annotation, the native compilation process would discard the "
"fields and methods during the dead-code elimination phase, which would lead "
"to runtime errors.\n"
"More details about the `@RegisterForReflection` annotation can be found on  "
"the xref:writing-native-applications-tips.adoc#registerForReflection[native "
"application tips] page."
msgstr ""

